{
  "D1早": {
    "total_ms": 55450,
    "total_chars": 217,
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "A01",
        "role": "奶奶",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
        "text": "又哭了？这盘棋输了，眼泪比棋子掉得还快。",
        "chars": 20,
        "speech_ms": 5690,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 0,
        "end_ms": 5690,
        "trace_id": "cached"
      },
      {
        "id": "A02",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "先别急着哄。",
        "chars": 6,
        "speech_ms": 1210,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 6090,
        "end_ms": 7300,
        "trace_id": "0747c87e4631bbf9b373fd43345dc2e0"
      },
      {
        "id": "A03",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "难过可以，眼泪也可以流，可棋子不能摔，棋盘不能推——先把棋子收好，收棋，就是认这盘的结果。",
        "chars": 45,
        "speech_ms": 10180,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 7800,
        "end_ms": 17980,
        "trace_id": "0747c881ea44891e1c3b01e8bc8cc1db"
      },
      {
        "id": "A04",
        "role": "奶奶",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
        "text": "可他说，爷爷故意赢他，不跟他玩了。",
        "chars": 17,
        "speech_ms": 3660,
        "pause_after_ms": 300,
        "start_ms": 18480,
        "end_ms": 22140,
        "trace_id": "0747c8834b44c6022e23cc3764f2a000"
      },
      {
        "id": "A05",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "我要是故意让，他赢十盘也学不会。",
        "chars": 16,
        "speech_ms": 3640,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 22440,
        "end_ms": 26080,
        "trace_id": "0747c886deceb7363f5136beefeed839"
      },
      {
        "id": "A06",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "孙子，听好：下棋跟过日子一样，输了先认，不摔、不赖、不笑话人。",
        "chars": 31,
        "speech_ms": 8100,
        "pause_after_ms": 600,
        "start_ms": 26480,
        "end_ms": 34580,
        "trace_id": "0747c8895142940f6cbdcca3accde026"
      },
      {
        "id": "A07",
        "role": "奶奶",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
        "text": "那下次呢？",
        "chars": 5,
        "speech_ms": 990,
        "pause_after_ms": 300,
        "start_ms": 35180,
        "end_ms": 36170,
        "trace_id": "0747c88b8c58615dcfe03ea2f7795e40"
      },
      {
        "id": "A08",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "下次开局前先说好三条：不摔棋子，不许悔棋，赢了不笑话人。",
        "chars": 28,
        "speech_ms": 7150,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 36470,
        "end_ms": 43620,
        "trace_id": "0747c88edf9c988fc42475f286ef07c2"
      },
      {
        "id": "A09",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "做不到，今天就不下了。",
        "chars": 11,
        "speech_ms": 2080,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 44020,
        "end_ms": 46100,
        "trace_id": "0747c8906101b3a0d878aaa2bf1e000a"
      },
      {
        "id": "A10",
        "role": "奶奶",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
        "text": "行，规矩说在前面，比输了再讲道理管用。",
        "chars": 19,
        "speech_ms": 4030,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 46600,
        "end_ms": 50630,
        "trace_id": "0747c89399b1a2fa1ef81ec5dddb9713"
      },
      {
        "id": "A11",
        "role": "奶奶",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
        "text": "等他心平了，再陪他看看这盘输在哪一步。",
        "chars": 19,
        "speech_ms": 3820,
        "pause_after_ms": 600,
        "start_ms": 51030,
        "end_ms": 54850,
        "trace_id": "0747c8963d60338a068ddb2e294ce19f"
      }
    ]
  },
  "D1午": {
    "total_ms": 44330,
    "total_chars": 189,
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "A01",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "您见过轻轨从居民楼里穿过去的吗？",
        "chars": 16,
        "speech_ms": 3100,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 0,
        "end_ms": 3100,
        "trace_id": "0747c89829132cc4eb7fa624277a4302"
      },
      {
        "id": "A02",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "在重庆李子坝，列车从居民楼中间几层钻进钻出，站就设在楼里，车站和住户各走各的门，互不打扰。",
        "chars": 45,
        "speech_ms": 10960,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 3600,
        "end_ms": 14560,
        "trace_id": "0747c89ba5595e6eaa026620b8793c15"
      },
      {
        "id": "A03",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "很多人以为，这是楼盖好了、轨道硬塞进去的。",
        "chars": 21,
        "speech_ms": 3880,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 14960,
        "end_ms": 18840,
        "trace_id": "0747c89e92884941ff9e11651073dba6"
      },
      {
        "id": "A04",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "其实不是：车站和大楼是同期设计的，轨道从楼里预留的位置通过。",
        "chars": 30,
        "speech_ms": 6980,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 19240,
        "end_ms": 26220,
        "trace_id": "0747c8a0d1cd4eacc6666d482401da46"
      },
      {
        "id": "A05",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "山城的地形逼出了这个办法：地不够平，就往空中要路。",
        "chars": 25,
        "speech_ms": 5270,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 26620,
        "end_ms": 31890,
        "trace_id": "0747c8a3f61b0ddd62380d6b9d9d0fb9"
      },
      {
        "id": "A06",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "这一穿，穿成了重庆的名片，全国的人跑来看。",
        "chars": 21,
        "speech_ms": 4230,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 32390,
        "end_ms": 36620,
        "trace_id": "0747c8a68e34231cbe9625a0f481a05a"
      },
      {
        "id": "A07",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "下次去重庆，别光在楼下拍照，坐一趟车亲身穿一回楼，那才叫过瘾。",
        "chars": 31,
        "speech_ms": 6710,
        "pause_after_ms": 600,
        "start_ms": 37020,
        "end_ms": 43730,
        "trace_id": "0747c8a8ff643130a2e9d431cebb1af1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "D1晚": {
    "total_ms": 71270,
    "total_chars": 298,
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "A01",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "半夜十一点，亲戚打来电话：孩子住院，押金还差两万——这样的钱，您借不借？",
        "chars": 36,
        "speech_ms": 8480,
        "pause_after_ms": 600,
        "start_ms": 0,
        "end_ms": 8480,
        "trace_id": "0747c8b347474a9160b3cb89a4880eb6"
      },
      {
        "id": "A02",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "这叫救急，人命关天的难处，搭把手是情分。",
        "chars": 20,
        "speech_ms": 4500,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 9080,
        "end_ms": 13580,
        "trace_id": "0747c8b60406d3f5d2c12567ffacaf50"
      },
      {
        "id": "A03",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "可还有一种借：借去填窟窿、堵亏空，填进去多少都是无底洞。",
        "chars": 28,
        "speech_ms": 6300,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 13980,
        "end_ms": 20280,
        "trace_id": "0747c8c1c1ea0262b5842f2f3302436f"
      },
      {
        "id": "A04",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "老话讲，救急不救穷。",
        "chars": 10,
        "speech_ms": 2450,
        "pause_after_ms": 600,
        "start_ms": 20780,
        "end_ms": 23230,
        "trace_id": "0747c8c3fcd559522b73fe7fbe9ffae3"
      },
      {
        "id": "A05",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "先说清：这句是民间老话，不是书里的原话；书里真正写着的，是《中国式人情世故》第二章那句——人情要厚积，关系在往来。",
        "chars": 57,
        "speech_ms": 13290,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 23830,
        "end_ms": 37120,
        "trace_id": "0747c8cea6bb34795c1606048dda1005"
      },
      {
        "id": "A06",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "再说我自己的做法：钱往外借之前，先把归还的约定说清楚，什么时候还、怎么还，当场说明白，金额大小都一样。",
        "chars": 51,
        "speech_ms": 11370,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 37520,
        "end_ms": 48890,
        "trace_id": "0747c8d18eb3fb5303b6d20006047e7d"
      },
      {
        "id": "A07",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "这钱舍不舍得当人情送了，是借之前自己拿的主意，不是借出去以后被迫算了。",
        "chars": 35,
        "speech_ms": 7160,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 49290,
        "end_ms": 56450,
        "trace_id": "0747c8d4cb479e07562d25b426ed05f6"
      },
      {
        "id": "A08",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "约定在先，钱借得安心，交情也处得长久。",
        "chars": 19,
        "speech_ms": 4460,
        "pause_after_ms": 500,
        "start_ms": 56950,
        "end_ms": 61410,
        "trace_id": "0747c8d8a8271ba5ef02d43be13578cf"
      },
      {
        "id": "A09",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
        "chars": 27,
        "speech_ms": 5330,
        "pause_after_ms": 400,
        "start_ms": 61910,
        "end_ms": 67240,
        "trace_id": "0747c8e34c609eb0ef6e9b398ccea6cc"
      },
      {
        "id": "A10",
        "role": "爷爷",
        "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
        "text": "您借出去的钱，后来要回来了吗？",
        "chars": 15,
        "speech_ms": 2820,
        "pause_after_ms": 800,
        "start_ms": 67640,
        "end_ms": 70460,
        "trace_id": "0747c8e6df10d3db6cdf027180d5dc83"
      }
    ]
  }
}